ackground-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-09-17/30947_6.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_0075.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">リボンとお<ruby>花<rt>はな</rt></ruby>がぎっしり<ruby>詰<rt>つ</rt></ruby>まっているのお<ruby>花<rt>はな</rt></ruby>！とても<ruby>綺麗<rt>きれい</rt></ruby>でした</span><span class=\"s2\">😳</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>今回<rt>こんかい</rt></ruby>はここまで！<ruby>続<rt>つづ</rt></ruby>きはまた<ruby>更新<rt>こうしん</rt></ruby><ruby>致<rt>いた</rt></ruby>します！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>凄<rt>すご</rt></ruby>い<ruby>凝<rt>こ</rt></ruby>っているお<ruby>花<rt>はな</rt></ruby>ばかりで<ruby>感動<rt>かんどう</rt></ruby>です</span><span class=\"s3\">…</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">すごく<ruby>伝<rt>つた</rt></ruby>わってきます</span><span class=\"s3\">…</span><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>嬉<rt>うれ</rt></ruby>しいなぁ</span><span class=\"s3\">…</span></span></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-09-17/30947_7.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_0083.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">それでは！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><sp